 tress recites the Spam-filled menu\, a group of Viking patrons drown out a
 ll conversations with a song\, repeating “Spam\, Spam\, Spam\, Spam… L
 ovely Spam! Wonderful Spam!”\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spam_(Mont
 y_Python_sketch)
