SUMMARY:🍝 Tortellini Day 🍝
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250213
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250214
UID:pastafarian-2025-02-13
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
DESCRIPTION:National Tortellini Day is celebrated on February 13th each ye
 ar. Tortellini is a signature dish from the Italian region of Bologna\, a 
 small\, ring-shaped pasta typically filled with a mixture of ingredients s
 uch as cheese\, meat\, or vegetables. According to legend\, the shape of t
 ortellini pasta is inspired by the navel of the goddess of love\, Venus.\n
