DESCRIPTION:World Penguin Day is observed on April 25th each year and enco
 urages people to learn more about penguins and their environment\, how imp
 ortant they are to our ecosystems\, and the threats they face. World Pengu
 in Day takes place during the annual northern migration of Adelie penguins
 \, a species native to Antarctica. Researchers at McMurdo Station noticed 
 that Adelie penguins kept passing by every year around the same day\, Apri
 l 25th.\n\nhttps://nationaltoday.com/world-penguin-day/
