DESCRIPTION:The Blue-footed Booby has captivated the human imagination for
  centuries with its mating display\, in which its vivid baby-blue feet pla
 y a key role. The other part of the name—booby—is reportedly taken fro
 m the Spanish for “stupid\,” (“bobo”) and refers to these birds’
  tameness around people. Like its North Atlantic relative the Northern Gan
 net\, Blue-footed Boobies catch fish in spectacular dives from high in the
  air. Watching large flocks pursue shoaling fish can be breathtaking\, wit
 h hundreds plunging into the ocean at any moment.\n\nhttps://www.allaboutb
 irds.org/guide/Blue-footed_Booby/overview
LOCATION:Pastafarian Holy Day
URL:https://www.pastafariancalendar.com/blue-footed-booby-day-2025-06-27?u
 tm_source=ical&utm_medium=ical
