  meals for most people. These little balls of various meats can be found t
 hroughout the world in almost every culture. Most people may associate the
 m with Italian cuisine\, though spaghetti and meatballs is actually an Ame
 rican dish. No matter your background\, you can jump in and enjoy National
  Meatball Day!\n\nhttps://www.daysoftheyear.com/days/meatball-day/
