DESCRIPTION:On April 2nd\, Hob and Jill went up the hill with their little
  Kits to celebrate National Ferret Day because that's some serious busines
 s. Male ferrets are called Hobs\, and female ferrets are called Jills. The
 ir offspring are called Kits. The whole family is called a business. These
  carnivores join the mustelid family\, including the otter\, badger\, weas
 el\, marten\, mink\, and wolverine.\n\nhttps://www.nationaldaycalendar.com
 /national-day/national-ferret-day-april-2
