DESCRIPTION:The International Guild of Knot Tyers created World Knot Tying
  Day to celebrate and remember the author Clifford W Ashley\, who wrote an
 d illustrated The Ashley Book of Knots.\nParticipants were asked to tie th
 eir favorite knot and also learn a new knot.\nMaybe also teach someone how
  to tie a knot?\nEven teaching someone to tie their shoelaces was sufficie
 nt.\nWhen the knots were tied\, participants were encouraged to post a pho
 to of their knot on their favorite social media site with the hashtag #Wor
 ldKnotTyingDay.\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Guild_of_
 Knot_Tyers#World_Knot_Tying_Day
LOCATION:Pastafarian Holy Day
URL:https://www.pastafariancalendar.com/knot-day-2025-10-09?utm_source=ica
