DESCRIPTION:World Pasta Day is celebrated on October 25th to honor one of 
 the world's favorite and most versatile foods. The world first celebrated 
 the day during the inaugural World Pasta Congress in Rome\, Italy\, on Oct
 ober 25\, 1995. The International Pasta Organisation has organized World P
 asta Day every year since 1998\, hosting conferences in various cities thr
 oughout the world.\n\nhttps://nationaltoday.com/world-pasta-day/
LOCATION:Pastafarian Holy Day
