DESCRIPTION:World Toilet Day is an official United Nations international o
 bservance day on November 19 to inspire action to tackle the global sanita
 tion crisis. On November 19\, 2001\, the NGO World Toilet Organization was
  founded by Jack Sim\, a philanthropist from Singapore\, who declared Nove
 mber 19 as World Toilet Day. In 2013\, the UN officially recognized Novemb
 er 19 as World Toilet Day in a bid to make sanitation for all a global dev
 elopment priority.\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Toilet_Day
