DESCRIPTION:Ludwig van Beethoven was baptised December 17\, 1770\, and the
  consensus (with which Beethoven himself agreed) is that his birth date wa
 s December 16\, 1770. He was a German composer and pianist whose works ran
 k among the most performed classical music repertoire.\n\nhttps://en.wikip
