DESCRIPTION:The Rum Rebellion occurred on January 26\, 1808\, when Governo
 r William Bligh was deposed by the New South Wales Corps - the first and o
 nly time in Australian history that military force has been used to overth
 row a government. This date is now celebrated as Australia Day.\n\nhttps:/
 /en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rum_Rebellion
