  in the culture of alcoholic beverages may not know the difference between
  bourbon and whiskey\, which is certainly okay! This is the perfect day to
  learn. National Bourbon Day has been set aside as a day to learn about an
 d appreciate this fine liquor which some people refer to as the “Spirit 
 of America”.\n\nhttp://www.nationalbourbonday.com/
