DESCRIPTION:National Martini Day is on June 19th in the United States\, Ca
 nada\, and United Kingdom\, also called World Martini Day. Traditionally m
 ade with gin and vermouth and garnished with an olive or a lemon twist\, t
 he martini is renowned for its clarity\, simplicity\, and elegance. In 201
 2\, Belvedere Vodka celebrated the first World Martini Day\, and the follo
 wing year they raised the world's largest toast.\n\nhttps://nationaltoday.
 com/national-martini-day/
