DESCRIPTION:Created and organized by the HerbDay Coalition\, an organizati
 on of five non-profit groups\, the holiday encourages people to learn more
  about herbs and use them more extensively in their daily lives. The holid
 ay\, which first began in 2006 in the United States\, brings together herb
 alists\, gardeners\, manufacturers of herbal products\, culinarians and ho
 me cooks\, and the general public. It attempts to spread knowledge about t
 he medicinal\, culinary and cosmetic benefits of herbs.\n\nhttps://www.tim
 eanddate.com/holidays/fun/herb-day
