 aroni\, as we celebrate National Macaroni Day on July 7. This little elbow
 -shaped pasta is such a fan-favorite that it gets its own day of celebrati
 on. As it should! Apparently\, macaroni is the most common form of pasta i
 n the U.S. So on this day\, let’s all come together to show our love for
  the humble and versatile macaroni.\n\nhttps://nationaltoday.com/national-
