DESCRIPTION:World Rum Day is celebrated every year on the second Saturday 
 of July\, which falls on July 11th in 2026. Launched in 2019 by Paul Jacks
 on\, this international holiday honors the rich history and diverse flavor
 s of rum\, a spirit deeply intertwined with Caribbean cultural heritage.\n
 \nhttps://www.daysoftheyear.com/days/world-rum-day/
