DESCRIPTION:Festivus is a secular holiday celebrated on December 23 as an 
 alternative to the perceived pressures and commercialism of the Christmas 
 season. Originally created by author Daniel O'Keefe\, Festivus entered pop
 ular culture after it was made the focus of the 1997 Seinfeld episode “T
 he Strike”\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Festivus
