DESCRIPTION:Boxing Day is a holiday celebrated on December 26th primarily 
 in the United Kingdom and other Commonwealth nations\, traditionally when 
 servants and tradespeople would receive “Christmas boxes” containing g
 ifts and bonuses from their employers. Today\, it's known as a major shopp
 ing holiday featuring significant sales and discounts\, similar to Black F
 riday in the United States\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boxing_Day
